st-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:93%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:12.0pt;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 15.2pt; margin-right: 5pt; text-indent: -15.2pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:95%;font-size:12.0pt;\">아울러</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:95%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:95%;font-size:12.0pt;\">뱀은 </span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-hansi-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:95%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">「</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:95%;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">야생 동</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-hansi-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:95%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">‧</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:95%;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">식물 보호법</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-hansi-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:95%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">」</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:95%;font-size:12.0pt;\">에 따라 </span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:95%;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">일반인의 포획이 금지</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:95%;font-size:12.0pt;\">되어 있고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:95%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:95%;font-size:12.0pt;\">포획하려고 시도하다가 물림 사고가 발생할 수 있으니 </span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:95%;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">발견 즉시 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:95%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;color:#ff0000;\">119</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:95%;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">로 신고</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:95%;font-size:12.0pt;\">하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:95%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 100%; margin-left: 15.2pt; margin-right: 5pt; text-indent: -15.2pt; word-break: keep-all; font-size: 6pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;</p><table style=\"border-width: initial; border-style: none; border-color: initial;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width:163.47pt;height:2.82pt;padding:1.41pt 5.10pt 1.41pt 5.10pt;border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.28pt;border-right:none;\" valign=\"middle\"><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p></td><td style=\"width:163.47pt;height:2.82pt;padding:1.41pt 5.10pt 1.41pt 5.10pt;border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.28pt;border-right:none;\" valign=\"middle\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align:center;word-break:keep-all;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">&lt;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">뱀 물림 사고 예방 방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">&gt;</span></p></td><td style=\"width:163.47pt;height:2.82pt;padding:1.41pt 5.10pt 1.41pt 5.10pt;border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.28pt;border-right:none;\" valign=\"middle\"><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"width:490.41pt;height:68.80pt;padding:1.41pt 5.10pt 1.41pt 5.10pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.28pt;border-left:solid #000000 0.28pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.28pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.28pt;\" valign=\"middle\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:140%;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">◦ </span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">일반적으로 뱀은 사람을 피하며 먼저 공격하지 않으므로 </span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">절대로 접근하면 안 됨</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:140%;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">◦ </span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">보행 시 모르고 밟는 경우가 없도록 </span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">항상 바닥을 확인</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">하여야 함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:140%;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">◦ </span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">뱀이 숨어 있을 수 있는 </span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">구석진 곳</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">틈새 등</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">에는 </span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">손이나 발을 넣지 말아야 함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:140%;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">◦ </span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">뱀의 활동 시간인 </span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">야간</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">에는 </span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">활동을 자제</span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">하고 어두운 곳은 다니지 않아야 함</span> </span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; word-break: keep-all; font-size: 12pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">붙임&nbsp; &nbsp;뱀 물림 사고 시&nbsp;주의사항 및 응급처치 각 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;f